{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y中部分定时出现的感受信息容易在听音乐时错过，X的固定左右分栏更方便随时回看，叙事与感受也更容易分开扫读。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y虽然感受信息更多，但通过【】突出叙事锚点、感受字缩小以及按乐句出现，把信息组织成了有先后关系的体验，而不是简单堆词。尤其是从舍不得被当作自己人、害怕孤单，到重新理解离开、接受想念并决定继续生活，人物动机和情绪转变都比X更具体，音乐中的情绪起伏也有更细致的对应。X的优势是静态扫读更轻松、叙事句子更自然完整，但部分音乐感受停留在概括层面，细节之间的变化和前后呼应不如Y充分。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e64fdb4c-a25d-4eee-9755-13ff74ba44be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000927633728Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:10:45.855607+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1fcae49731e7874b677bd42eab7e9ecb50e42d0a5d427628dfd2d1077ef0d566", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f458